sort to cannibalism to stay alive...that is ..until the rescue planes come to pick them up and the man eating sharks decide its time to eat as well.","tagline":"The terror storm was only the beginning... but the SHARKS would be the merciless end"},{"language":"es-ES","title":"Ciclón","overview":"Unos turistas que navegan por el Caribe en una barcaza son sorprendidos, de repente, por un terrible ciclón y quedan a la deriva en alta mar. Conservan la esperanza de que alguien los rescate, pero, mientras tanto, tendrán que hacer frente a la sed, al hambre, a la insolación y a los voraces tiburones que los acechan."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hICnL1hlHb9GpVtd6rASGJtbJzu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sbDXfooL1KJipQFugzC8fsv6EHG.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":42202,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6xeJ4qtyJHMCl4s4alGDO41WczC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6xeJ4qtyJHMCl4s4alGDO41WczC.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6xeJ4qtyJHMCl4s4alGDO41WczC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6xeJ4qtyJHMCl4s4alGDO41WczC.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Iylqfw8VwFOtKbbhiXLz09ieD9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4Iylqfw8VwFOtKbbhiXLz09ieD9.jpg","language":"en","width":1130,"height":1695},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yH8R8saCzWAIDXES9P5v9rRKF1f.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yH8R8saCzWAIDXES9P5v9rRKF1f.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p